        "r": 537.1229624999994,
        "b": 586.6875
      },
      "content": "WARNING: Do not place the N5500 into operation after repair or maintenance has been performed, until all Performance Tests and Safety Tests listed in section 3 of this service manual have been performed. Failure to perform all tests could result in erroneous monitor readings.",
      "severity": "warning"
    },
